                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                        "entry_id": "7fb5232d-b500-36f6-b782-78afecce3ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of kidney-shaped (“having an approximately circular or elongated ovoid shape with an inward curve or indentation on one side”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16de4aa7-fb92-45ca-a367-e55986e6b80b",
                                                "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                                "text": "intussusception with a reniform appearance"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ea434cf-a2ad-4e8e-8e42-74cb049b40ea",
                                                "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                                "text": "multiple reniform circumscribed fat-containing masses"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d2ec583-91eb-4f53-b00c-b654ad3ee1ad",
                                                "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                                "text": "The Bean […] is oval, and not at all reniform'd like the Kidney-Beans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0d65826-37a8-41c2-8115-10991efaa3af",
                                                "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                                "text": "[T]he antheræ are reniform: the germen is oval, and obtuſely trigonal; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f857d8a-ec7e-41a4-a358-36a81a8fc6fa",
                                                "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                                "text": "In one of the ſegments of the lovver portion of the kidney, there vvas a large reniform Papillæ, in the outer circumference of vvhich a ſmall part of the papillary fleſh vvas vvanting. […] In the oppoſite ſegment, there vvas a fourth reniform Papilla, reſembling the firſt; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65f3cb69-a2a2-4ded-917f-941c7fa162ce",
                                                "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                                "text": "The oxyde of cobalt, […] is found either ſuperficial, interſperſed, or in lumps; ſometimes botryoidal or reniform or bearing particular impreſſions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25fbd2ea-8db0-42f4-a62e-c612b06f96e7",
                                                "sense_id": "283f2c59-18b7-3415-90fa-c0313bbf45a5",
                                                "text": "Nothing could be more simple than the furniture. The chairs were either posts mounted on four legs spread out for a base, or three-legged stools with reniform seats."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "422f572a-da0b-3cd5-959e-47d4212f1c1f",
                                        "entry_id": "7fb5232d-b500-36f6-b782-78afecce3ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of kidney-shaped (“having an approximately circular or elongated ovoid shape with an inward curve or indentation on one side”).",
                                            "Of a leaf: kidney-shaped, with the petiole attached at the notch."
